  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Canadian Refugees Resettlement Travel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM supports the resettlement process of selected individuals under the resettlement scheme of the Government of Canada, with the provision of transportation from the point of departure to the final destination in Canada. This includes assistance with travel within the country of residence, as well as international travel, assistance at the time of departure, including immigration and airline checks, assistance in points of transit, providing escorts for the resettlement travel, when needed, and assistance to un-accompanied minors and people with special needs. This project covers assistance fees.</narrative>
  </description>
